latent_alignment_distribution,潜空间对齐与分布匹配 (Latent Space Alignment & Distribution Matching),latent space alignment domain adaptation geometric interpretation NeurIPS ICML 2024,1,Probabilistic Geometric Alignment via Bayesian Latent Transport for ...,https://arxiv.org/html/2603.23783v2,arxiv.org,0.9998568,"Framework overview in Fig. 1, the proposed probabilistic uncertainty-aware foundation model adaptation framework is illustrated.
