multimodal_crossdomain,多模态与跨域映射 (Multi-Modal & Cross-Domain Mapping),seamless embedding space cross-modal alignment geometric deep learning 2024,10,Firebolt-VL: Efficient Vision-Language Understanding with Cross-Modality Modulation,https://arxiv.org/html/2604.04579v1,arxiv.org,0.95979,"To overcome these limitations, in Firebolt-VL, we introduce the Cross-Modal Modulator (CMM), which is designed via the integration of a state-space model (SSM) [15, 17, 16] and FiLM [35] to fuse grid-level visual tokens with textual representations, and efficiently capture the long sequence features for the Large Language Model. From the benchmark results in Table 1 ‣ 3 Method ‣ Firebolt-VL: Efficient Vision-Language Understanding with Cross-Modality Modulation""), despite having fewer than 1B parameters, Firebolt-VL achieves competitive performance compared to much larger models (over 7B parameters), and clearly outperforms compact models in the 0.3B–3B range. To evaluate the effectiveness of the CMM module, we conduct experiments comparing three fusion strategies: (1) Prepend, where the projected image features from the MLP layer are passed through the language Model; (2) Cross-attend, where cross-attention follows Q-Former implementation [23] is applied to enable interaction between visual and textual features; and (3) CMM (ours), the proposed module that integrates state-space modeling for efficient and structured cross-modal fusion.",True
